<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-KEY MATCH STATISTICS OF FRANCE V ITALY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KEY MATCH STATISTICS OF FRANCE V ITALY.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official statistics supplied by</p>
<p>Tournoi organisers after France's 2-2 draw with Italy in the</p>
<p>closing Tournoi de France match on Wednesday:</p>
<p>			France		 Italy</p>
<p> Goals		 2			  2</p>
<p> Goal Attempts     3			  5</p>
